\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Target-drift agent lifecycle\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-11T05:31:45Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/actions/runs/38113425233/job/114393490590\",\"name\":\"build-and-probe-result-free-candidate\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-11T05:01:07Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Target-drift provider-client agent image\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-11T05:45:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/actions/runs/38113425208/job/114400307283\",\"name\":\"deploy\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-11T05:45:01Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Lean and documentation\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/219\"}"},{"sha":"09b5506d1c123c05a1620321e7a9085e4b9f96ff","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/preceding-unbounded-delivery-v1/live-PR220-all-files-v1.json","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Flive-PR220-all-files-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Flive-PR220-all-files-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Flive-PR220-all-files-v1.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8"},{"sha":"5356e03b5ede339eacd2163830159dde32fa2996","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/preceding-unbounded-delivery-v1/live-PR220-rest-v1.json","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Flive-PR220-rest-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Flive-PR220-rest-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fpreceding-unbounded-delivery-v1%2Flive-PR220-rest-v1.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/220\",\"id\":4817110712,\"node_id\":\"PR_kwDOTEdTLM8AAAABHx9GuA\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/220\",\"diff_url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/220.diff\",\"patch_url\":\"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pull/220.patch\",\"issue_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/220\",\"number\":220,\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"Formalize actual decreasing-step OGD failure on unbounded domains\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jicheng9617\",\"id\":74550583,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTUwNTgz\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74550583?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jicheng9617\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/jicheng9617/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"Prove that the explicit affine construction in Orabona v10 Theorem 5.4 also drives actual variable-step OGD on the full Euclidean space. Preserve the exact horizon threshold, half-phi lower bound, zero initialization/comparator and source schedule; construct globally convex, 1-Lipschitz, differentiable losses.\\n\\nTwo complete public canaries check the actual scalar two-round trajectory (explicitly below the source threshold) and a 64-round two-dimensional witness with the printed bound, at least 256/15 and strictly more than 17. Shared Book integration preserves all 11,100 previous canonical nodes and adds one producer node.\\n\\nSeparate source reconciliation accepts exactly three frozen target rows within one unbounded-variable-OGD container. Seven Chapter 2 forward containers, six future mathematical claims and B1-B7 repairs remain open. Chapter 2 stays partial with a null complete proof denominator; the Chapters 1-16 Goal remains active. Loss families may depend on T; no single infinite stream or all-schedules result is claimed.\\n\\nValidation at source/metadata commit `609da50f3f5a41dca9ff2ab6d6d0cf8559d89487`: combined Lean root (9,122 jobs), Tests (9,303 jobs), full harness (472 tests, 7 skipped), public canaries, standard-axiom audit, contributor check, site build/check, registry preservation and three independently viewed original local screenshots. Actual failed site-status validation and its one-field repair are retained. Individual native fences ran; the native whole-loop did not.\\n\\nEvidence/delivery commit: `8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59`. Acceptance: `runs/online-ch2-unbounded-ogd-20261011/accepted-current-source-target-package-v1.json` SHA256 `55229d09bb8ef9e1a7ba16245fdd423c1c5870a576413978806dee1dc378efc3`; independent post-adoption FINAL SHA256 `98148c5a2b582ec8a2d7a5a1d6c925171bfaea6e068c67686e3e13a54ff8c059`. Selected 1,309 source/input paths and RAW hashes remain identical after the evidence-only commit.\\n\\nStacked on `codex/research-online-ch2-target-freeze` at `f86aaded30581da02eba1f0a8691f990cf9ed4f3` (draft PR #219). Main independently advanced to `fea256b1c03b14b79c6c84a965e8ac2b5a738f64`; integration with latest main remains a later gate. This package is unmerged and unpublished; no live-site claim.\\n\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-11T06:31:59Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-11T06:31:59Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"merged_at\":null,\"merge_commit_sha\":\"03a77eddd3a4250f9a51053a6fbe5a2f1da7e79d\",\"assignees\":[],\"requested_reviewers\":[],\"requested_teams\":[],\"labels\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"draft\":true,\"commits_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/220/commits\",\"review_comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/220/comments\",\"review_comment_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}\",\"comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/220/comments\",\"statuses_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59\",\"head\":{\"label\":\"DakeBU:codex/research-online-ch2-unbounded-ogd\",\"ref\":\"codex/research-online-ch2-unbounded-ogd\",\"sha\":\"8045070bf1ee53c83778d04eb168f8ad6f728b59\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"DakeBU\",\"id\":159223240,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDOCX2NyA\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159223240?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/use