/truth_boundary\",\n+      \"equals\": \"Candidate bounded Euclidean prescient leaf only. Seven required Chapter 2 containers and all six future mathematical claims remain open. In particular the whole prescient container is NOT closed: mandatory repair:7.47-terminal and repair:15.31-terminal remain open. B1-B7 and every other difficult target are retained. Chapter 2 partial, accepted=false, complete proof denominator=null; Chapters1-16 Goal ACTIVE. No declaration-count closure, main update, merge, deployment, live verification, purification or native whole-loop acceptance is claimed. Latest main fea256b was merged INTO this isolated candidate branch, not the reverse.\",\n+      \"meaning\": \"Chapter2 partial\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"Goal_status_boundary\": \"Only the local manifest statement is checked; parent must separately obtain actual Goal tool status.\",\n+  \"runtime_attestation\": null\n+}"},{"sha":"0e579828a2563455e84306d32795da7a27c9f12e","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/prepared-structural-v1/preparation-v1.json","status":"added","additions":57,"deletions":0,"changes":57,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fprepared-structural-v1%2Fpreparation-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fprepared-structural-v1%2Fpreparation-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fprepared-structural-v1%2Fpreparation-v1.json?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,57 @@\n+{\n+  \"status\": \"prepared only; checker not executed; no gate/build run\",\n+  \"actor\": \"/root/adaptive_decoder\",\n+  \"requested_model_effort\": \"GPT-6 Astra / medium\",\n+  \"runtime_attestation\": null,\n+  \"helper\": {\n+    \"path\": \"tmp/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-structural-20261011/check-prescient-structure-v3.py\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"5b3040e480afbc7119c359bbde06bf7c7664bd8053b0e1293969f9a1e1d3fb23\"\n+  },\n+  \"spec_prepared\": {\n+    \"path\": \"tmp/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-structural-20261011/input-spec-prepared-v1.json\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"4531d771d23cc19884aa728abbce5b6da3a48e9691c4032d90d8f78eb7cd9154\",\n+    \"executable\": false\n+  },\n+  \"argv_template\": [\n+    \"python\",\n+    \"-X\",\n+    \"utf8\",\n+    \"tmp\\\\online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-structural-20261011\\\\check-prescient-structure-v3.py\",\n+    \"--root\",\n+    \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book\",\n+    \"--site\",\n+    \"<ACTUAL_GENERATED_SITE_DIR>\",\n+    \"--gate\",\n+    \"<ACTUAL_COMBINED_CAPTURE_DIR>/receipt.json\",\n+    \"--before\",\n+    \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/integration-snapshots/before\",\n+    \"--old-registry\",\n+    \"<PINNED_11101_NODE_REGISTRY_JSON>\",\n+    \"--spec\",\n+    \"<REVIEWED_EXECUTION_SPEC_JSON>\",\n+    \"--output\",\n+    \"<IGNORED_CREATE_ONLY_RESULT_JSON>\",\n+    \"--head\",\n+    \"<ACTUAL_CLEAN_GATE_HEAD>\",\n+    \"--gate-sha256\",\n+    \"<ACTUAL_RECEIPT_SHA256>\",\n+    \"--old-registry-sha256\",\n+    \"<BASELINE_REGISTRY_SHA256>\",\n+    \"--spec-sha256\",\n+    \"<REVIEWED_EXECUTION_SPEC_SHA256>\"\n+  ],\n+  \"mutable_allowlist\": [\n+    \"one --output create-only JSON file when separately authorized\"\n+  ],\n+  \"review_notes\": [\n+    \"Python3.8 standard library only; no prepared checker execution or py_compile performed.\",\n+    \"All paths/HEAD/gate/spec/baseline pins are CLI inputs. Exact current evidence hashes are in prepared spec. Future reviewed successor spec must set ready_for_execution true and bind rendered views.\",\n+    \"Module folds compare raw source header, not neutral complete explicit section headers. Freeze and BODY evidence are separately hash-bound.\",\n+    \"All old11101 registry nodes are compared as whole parsed objects; new IDs are precisely three production declarations. Test2 are not source counts.\",\n+    \"All three metadata documents are compared after reversing only the package append changes: one module glob, one grouped card and three highlights. MANIFEST historical5515 normalization to88745 is validated only through historical receipt.\",\n+    \"Schema3 source topology nodes and actual Lean node lists are checked separately. Marker checks for source/VALUE render views must be supplied from actual reviewed renderer paths; no invented graph page.\",\n+    \"Geometry Mathlib parents remain in actual VALUE export and lean_notes even when local-registry dependencies is empty.\",\n+    \"Goal ACTIVE checks local metadata wording only; actual Goal tool status is outside this filesystem helper.\",\n+    \"Standalone read diagnostic failed once due Windows gbk Unicode output; no checker execution occurred.\"\n+  ]\n+}"},{"sha":"468bc50f0b6700fc034f1102d1bb779294cf3ec7","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/prepared-structural-v1/preparation-v1.md","status":"added","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changes":11,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fprepared-structural-v1%2Fpreparation-v1.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fprepared-structural-v1%2Fpreparation-v1.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011%2Fprepared-structural-v1%2Fpreparation-v1.md?ref=b8a4b13ca96709b1adff0d1907814dc3d3d76cc8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+# Prepared structural checker\n+\n+Preparation only. No checker, Lean build, full gate, site build or source mutation was performed. Runtime model identity is not attested.\n+\n+Use `check-prescient-structure-v3.py` (Python 3.8 standard library). Versions 1 and 2 are retained preparation history. `input-spec-prepared-v1.json` pins current files but is intentionally fail-closed (`ready_for_execution=false`): independently review it and create a successor execution spec after the final manifest and actual rendered view locations are settled. A successful structural run is not visual QA, source acceptance, chapter closure, or a Goal-tool status check.\n+\n+The exact argument array is in `preparation-v1.json`; angle-bracket arguments are required future evidence bindings, not runnable placeholders. The only authorized future write is the absent result path passed through `--output`; all repository, site and gate inputs are read-only. Both success and failure produce a create-only report.\n+\n+Checks cover core3/Test2 and frozen/review hashes; all11101 old complete registry objects and exactly3 additions; complete old parsed content preservation after reversing the one card/three highlights/module append; source topology versus actual VALUE expansion; preserved source gap; Chapter2 partial/null with7+6; B4 terminal repairs open; five governance inputs in exact RAW inventories and selected ZIP bytes; actual gate exit/integrity/cleanHEAD and proof-source URLs. Historical MANIFEST normalization is receipt-bound, never assumed to equal current post-merge MANIFEST.\n+\n+The local registry does not contain Mathlib parents. An empty geometry dependency edge list is compatible only with retaining all three selected names in its reader notes and in actual VALUE constants. The checker does not reinterpret a renderer limitation as a mathematical gap."},{"sha":"6a250c1a8bb2aaffee688bc22fed762f131e11f3","filename":"runs/online-ch2-prescient-euclidean-20261011/prepared-structural-v1/preparation-v4-delta.json","status":"added","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changes":